          "settings": {
            "title": "Delivery, Damage & Returns",
            "liquid": "<!-- DELIVERY, DAMAGE & RETURNS — PRODUCT PAGE DROPDOWN -->\n<div style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; line-height: 1.55; color: #101828;\">\n<div style=\"border: 1px solid #eaecf0; border-radius: 12px; padding: 12px;\">\n<div style=\"font-weight: 800; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">🚚 Delivery, Damage &amp; Returns</div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\">\n<div style=\"font-weight: 800;\">🚛 Pallet Delivery (Tiles &amp; SPC)</div>\n<div style=\"color: #475467; font-size: 14px;\">Delivered on a pallet (kerbside only). Driver cannot unpack or move goods inside.</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\">\n<div style=\"font-weight: 800;\">💥 Damage / Incorrect Delivery</div>\n<div style=\"color: #475467; font-size: 14px;\">Notify us within <strong>2 working days</strong> of delivery for replacements or refunds. Please provide photos while items are <strong>still on the pallet</strong>. If you added <strong>Extended Delivery Protection (&pound;9.99)</strong>, you have <strong>4 working days</strong>. Do not dispose of goods or packaging.</div>\n<div style=\"margin-top: 6px; font-size: 14px;\">Email: <a style=\"color: #0b57d0; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 800;\" href=\"mailto:sales@tilesparadiseuk.com\"> sales@tilesparadiseuk.com </a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\">\n<div style=\"font-weight: 800;\">✅ Check Before Installation</div>\n<div style=\"color: #475467; font-size: 14px;\">Please inspect all tiles before cutting or installation. Claims cannot be accepted after cutting or installation. We recommend ordering a <strong>minimum 10% extra</strong> for cuts and wastage.</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\">\n<div style=\"font-weight: 800;\">🔄 Returns (Change of mind)</div>\n<div style=\"color: #475467; font-size: 14px;\">You may cancel your <strong>entire order</strong> within <strong>14 days</strong> of delivery. Returns must be unused, in original packaging and re-saleable. Tile &amp; SPC returns are subject to a&nbsp;<strong>handling/restocking fee</strong>. No returns on leftovers.</div>\n</div>\n<!-- FULL POLICY LINKS -->\n<div style=\"margin-top: 10px; font-size: 13px; color: #475467;\">View full policies: <a style=\"color: #0b57d0; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600;\" href=\"https://tilesparadiseuk.com/pages/shipping-policy\"> Delivery </a>, <a style=\"color: #0b57d0; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600;\" href=\"https://tilesparadiseuk.com/pages/damages\"> Damages </a> &amp; <a style=\"color: #0b57d0; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600;\" href=\"https://tilesparadiseuk.com/pages/refund-policy\"> Returns </a></div>\n</div>\n</div>",
